    use each of the following effects of "Myutant Beast" once per turn. When your
    opponent activates a Spell Card or effect (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 card
    from your hand or field; negate the activation, and if you do, banish that card.
    If this card in its owner''s possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card:
    You can target 1 of your banished "Myutant" Traps; add it to your hand.'
